      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.001a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.001a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "雨の休憩時間、うしろから遊びの提案があった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.001b",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.001b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「振り返らない散歩、というのは、どうでしょう」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.001c",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.001c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "ルールは、前を私、後ろを彼が歩くこと。振り返らない、それだけ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.002a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.002a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1ddw3j9",
      "speakerName": "うしろ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "振り返らないでいてくれる間、私は、いちばん近くを歩けるので。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.002b",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.002b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1ddw3j9",
      "speakerName": "うしろ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……その代わり、あなたの背後で見えるもの全部、実況します。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.003a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.003a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "歩き出してすぐ、この散歩の贅沢さが分かった。彼の実況は、視点が百二十七個ある。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.003b",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.003b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「右の曲がり角の先、清掃係さんが二度寝しています」「頭上の配管、猫が通行中。三匹目」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.003c",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.003c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "「あなたの落とした髪留め、三日前から自販機の下にあります」"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.004a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.004a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "髪留め!　ずっと探してたやつ!"
    },
    {
      "type": "direction",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.direction.still.001",
      "command": {
        "type": "still",
        "assetId": "ushiro.bond.asset.still.hairclip.001"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.005a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.005a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "自販機の下から、髪留めを救出してもらう。頭の上から、そっと手のひらに落とされた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.005b",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.005b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "指は見えない。ぬくもりだけ、一瞬あった。",
      "emotion": "tension"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.006a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.006a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "職場の裏側は、彼の実況で別の場所になった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.006b",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.006b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "誰も見ていない場所の親切、誰も気づかない場所の頑張り。掲示板の裏の四つ葉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.006c",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.006c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "うしろの世界は、正面の世界より、ずっと情報量が多い。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.007a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.007a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1ddw3j9",
      "speakerName": "うしろ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "……白状します。あなたの背後は、実況が、楽しい。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.007b",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.007b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1ddw3j9",
      "speakerName": "うしろ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "あなた、よく笑って、よく転びかけるので。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.008a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.008a",
      "speakerId": "mimi",
      "speakerName": "ミミ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "観察されてる!　ずっと観察する側だったのに、私!"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.009a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.009a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "接客業は、観察する側の商売。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.009b",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.009b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "お客様を読み、先回りする——はずが、今は読まれて、先回りされている。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.009c",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.009c",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "突き当たりの水たまり、案内済み。落ちた看板、警告済み。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.009d",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.009d",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "この落ち着かなさは、たぶん、悪いものじゃない。",
      "emotion": "revelation"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.010a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.010a",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1ddw3j9",
      "speakerName": "うしろ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "突き当たりです。……散歩は、ここまで。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.010b",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.010b",
      "speakerId": "legacy.speaker.1ddw3j9",
      "speakerName": "うしろ",
      "mode": "dialogue",
      "text": "振り返らないで。今、たぶん私は、少し赤いので。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.011a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.011a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "見えないくせに、そう言う。廊下の突き当たりで、背中合わせのまま雨の音を聞いた。"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.011b",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.011b",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "耳だけが、うしろを、ちゃんと感じていた。振り返らない約束が、こんなにドキドキするなんて。",
      "emotion": "tender"
    },
    {
      "type": "line",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.line.012a",
      "lineId": "ushiro.bond.line.012a",
      "speakerId": "narrator",
      "mode": "thought",
      "text": "休憩の残り時間の使い方を、背中合わせのまま決める。",
      "emotion": "resolve"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "id": "ushiro.bond.node.choice.001",
      "choices": [
